==Battleground==
*1 [[THE SLOTH]] spawns as the boss after 3.33 seconds<sup>100f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Jackie Peng]]s spawn after 120 seconds<sup>3,600f</sup>, delay 20~40 seconds<sup>600f~1,200f</sup>.
*1 [[Heavenly Hippoe]] spawns after 26.67 seconds<sup>800f</sup>.
*1 [[Angelic Gory]] spawns after 53.33 seconds<sup>1,600f</sup>.
*1 [[Heavenly Hippoe]] spawns after 80 seconds<sup>2,400f</sup>.
*1 [[Heavenly Hippoe]] spawns after 83.33 seconds<sup>2,500f</sup>.
*1 [[Angelic Gory]] spawns after 113.33 seconds<sup>3,400f</sup>.
*1 [[Angelic Gory]] spawns after 116.67 seconds<sup>3,500f</sup>.
*10 [[Gabriel]]s spawn after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>, delay 6.67~13.33 seconds<sup>200f~400f</sup>.

==Strategy==
[[Rocker Cat (Rare Cat)|Artist/Ramen Cat]] is quite useful here as it can tank hits from the Heavenly Hippoes and Angelic Gories which happen to be the main threats. Any cat that does a decent amount of damage should be able to take out THE SLOTH relatively quickly.

